  "description": "Azure cloud provider for SourceFlow.Net. Implements command dispatching via Azure Service Bus queues (with session-based ordering and duplicate detection) and event publishing via Azure Service Bus topics with full subscription management. Features include automatic bus bootstrapping as an IHostedService, Azure Key Vault envelope encryption, dead letter queue processing, batched message operations, circuit breaker and retry policies, health checks for the Service Bus namespace, and OpenTelemetry tracing. Supports .NET 8.0, 9.0, and 10.0.",
  "iconFile": "event-icon.png",
  "id": "SourceFlow.Cloud.Azure",
  "isPrerelease": true,
  "lastEdited": "2026-06-25T22:03:03.557Z",
